---
title: Sweet Pastry Dough
portions: 1
---

## Dough ~{-2h} ->&dough

[Mix] In a #food processor{}, combine the @flour{250 g}, the @butter{125 g}, the @sugar{80 g}, the @egg{1} and the @salt{1 pinch}. ->&crumbs{}

[Fraiser] Work the &crumbs quickly to gather into a ball without overworking it.

[Rest] Wrap in #cling film{} and refrigerate for at least ~_réfrigérateur{2 h}.
